message: "If you use this software or these data, please cite the preprint and this record."
title: "Sub-cell eigenmode descriptors for metamaterial homogenisation surrogates"
abstract: >-
  Code, precomputed sub-cell elastodynamic eigenmode descriptors, full experimental
  results and preprint for a study of why machine-learned surrogates for the homogenised
  stiffness tensor fail to transfer across unseen unit-cell topologies. Homogenisation
  volume-averages the microscopic stress, a projection that retains only the rigid
  translations of the cell; the discarded sub-cell content is measured here and shown to
  distinguish topologies that the stiffness tensor cannot distinguish at all.
type: software
